msgid ""
"Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — always verify content pasted from "
"the RCE preview in Canvas."
msgstr ""
"Canvas menyanitasi HTML yang ditempel di sisi server — selalu periksa konten "
"yang ditempel dari pratinjau RCE di Canvas."

