msgstr "Cara menggunakan halaman ini"

#: packages/scaffold/src/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "scaffold.canvas-theme-editor.i18n.helpModalBody1"
msgid ""
"Pick a starter template, edit it like you would in the Canvas Rich Content "
"Editor, then click <strong>Copy HTML</strong> and paste the result into a "
"Canvas page (switch to the HTML editor view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted "
"HTML server-side — this preview doesn't attempt to replicate that, so always "
"verify the pasted result in Canvas."
msgstr ""
"Pilih template awal, sunting seperti di Canvas Rich Content Editor, lalu "
"klik <strong>Copy HTML</strong> dan tempel hasilnya ke halaman Canvas "
"(alihkan ke tampilan editor HTML terlebih dahulu). Canvas menyanitasi HTML "
"yang ditempel di sisi server — pratinjau ini tidak mencoba meniru itu, jadi "
"selalu verifikasi hasil yang ditempel di Canvas."

#: packages/scaffold/src/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "scaffold.canvas-theme-editor.i18n.helpModalBody2"
msgid ""
"Use <strong>Edit theme</strong> to change the CDN provider, theme, or mode, "
"and to hand-edit the generated <code>theme.css</code>/<code>theme.js</code> "
"before downloading them."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan <strong>Edit theme</strong> untuk mengubah penyedia CDN, tema, atau "
"mode, dan untuk menyunting <code>theme.css</code>/<code>theme.js</code> yang "
"dihasilkan sebelum mengunduhnya."

